                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Aluminum Alloy: 2024-T4/2024-T351"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Product Forms: Aluminum Alloy, Rolled or Cold Finished Bars and Rods"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Condition: Solution Heat Treated, Cold Worked, and Artificially Aged"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Scope: This specification covers an aluminum alloy in the form of rolled or cold finished bars and rods."
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "Product availability: [Aluminum Alloy 2024-T4/2024-T351 round bar](https://titanium.com/shop/products/mill-products-aluminum-round-bar)"
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "DISCLAIMER: The use of this information should be considered strictly voluntary. Information contained in this page or across the domain, may contain typographical errors and are for reference only. Information presented are purely generalizations and are not a substitution for AMS specifications."
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "text": "DISCLAIMER: Alloy data sheets are for reference only, not for design purposes."
                },
